  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 14th level, a creature who fails the Will save against the dynamic warrior’s elite status is also subject to one compulsion that he knows and could qualify for at 2nd level. At 16th level this may be a compulsion of 6th level, at 18th it may be a 12th level compulsion, at at 20th it may be any compulsion.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dynamic-warrior#toc50\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
